message: "If you use SpaceOps in your research or project, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SpaceOps: Open-Source Storage Intelligence for Windows"
abstract: "An open-source storage intelligence application for Windows that combines a high-speed Rust filesystem scanning engine with a hardware-accelerated Direct2D squarified treemap, developer clutter detection across 8 toolchain ecosystems, and a cleanup model that routes deletions through the Windows Recycle Bin."
